name issue_126_audio_v2
describe Audio send path as libwebrtc M157: Opus frame sizes and RED, a clean link (issue #126)
# libwebrtc (CI parity data, clean_link and the other scenarios, mean of 10 seeds):
# net.audio_kbps 69.3-70.4, net.audio_size_p50_b 186-196, net.audio_size_p90_b 215-221.
# With `audio v1` (a constant 80 B frame, twice with RED) we send 85.2 kbps in 213 B packets.
# Seeds 1-5 with `audio v2`: 68-71 kbps, p50 191-195 B, p90 218-232 B.
duration 40s
at 0s capacity=5000kbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
expect net.audio_kbps > 64
expect net.audio_kbps < 75
expect net.audio_size_p50_b > 180
expect net.audio_size_p50_b < 200
expect net.audio_size_p90_b < 240
expect net.audio_size_max_b > 213
